  "title": "Rebekah J NDE 7196",
  "date": "July 4 1979",
  "content": "I was visiting relatives with my parents. They lived next door to the city pool. I went to the pool with my cousin. I was not able to swim but wanted to jump off the diving board. The kids at the pool said to just kick and I would be okay. I jumped off and hit the water. I panicked. I came up and went back down twice. The lifeguard wasn't watching and I went under the water a third time. Then suddenly I was somewhere else. I saw the most beautiful colors like a swirling rainbow tunnel. It was so bright. I saw shadowy figures like angels. I heard a voice. It was all around me. I do not know if it was male or female. It said, ‘you have a choice, you can continue on or go back.’ I thought for a moment then I thought, ‘I want to grow up and my parents would miss me’. The sense of peace and tranquility was overwhelming but I chose to go back. At that very moment, I was at the top of the water and close to the edge of the pool. The lifeguard stretched out her arm and pulled me out of the water. I was only under the water for a few seconds but when I was having my experience, it seemed to last about five minutes. Bystanders told me my body sunk to the bottom then suddenly my body shot up like it was pushed up out of the water. I became conscious only after coming back to the top of the water. Because of my experience, I do not fear death. I see it as a wonderful next step to a better place",
